## A teaching-focused academic profile grounded in discovery and support
:::

::: {.prose}
Carlos teaches microbiology, life science, and related courses while building learning environments that help students engage deeply with science. His academic work blends classroom practice, mentoring, scholarly communication, and course innovation in ways that support both scientific understanding and student belonging.

The site brings together research directions, publications, teaching materials, mentoring resources, and professional information in one place.
